OL,3,GNEWSAMP raises concerns over asbestos
OL,4,Ain ageing schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP has urged the government to
OL,7,Fdevelop a plan to deal with hundreds of
OL,8,Fschool buildings that campaigners fear
OL,9,Fcould contain large amounts of
OL,10,Fasbestos.
OL,12,FJames Naish, Labour MP for Rushcliffe
OL,13,Fin Nottinghamshire, has called for an
OL,14,Foverarching strategic solution because
OL,15,Fthe county has "such a prevalence" of
OL,16,Fbuildings constructed using a
OL,17,Fparticular method called CLASP.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
