OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(E)
OL,3,GNEWSAMP raises concerns over asbestos
OL,4,Ain ageing schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FCLASP, which stands for Consortium of
OL,7,FLocal Authorities Special Programme,
OL,8,Fwas a building system that used a
OL,9,Fprefabricated, lightweight steel frame
OL,10,Fto meet demand for new school
OL,11,Fbuildings.
OL,13,FNaish said: "The longer term issue is
OL,14,Fthat there are hundreds of schools that
OL,15,Fare going to need be rebuilt in the not
OL,16,Ftoo distant future."
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
